<script>
  import reports from '#lib/data/reports-4471.json';
  import notes from '#lib/data/desk-notes.json';
  import CauseTable from '#lib/kb/CauseTable.svelte';
  import Callout from '#lib/kb/Callout.svelte';
  import RenderStamp from '#lib/kb/RenderStamp.svelte';
  import { groupByCause, readAs, uniqueById } from '#lib/kb/causes';
  import { tenantOf } from '#lib/kb/locales';

  const merged = uniqueById(reports).filter((r) => r.mergedInto === 4471);
  const groups = groupByCause(merged, tenantOf);
  const g = (c) => groups.find((x) => x.cause === c);
  const oneDay = readAs(g('parser'), notes.oneDayMove);
  const parser = g('parser').reports.length - oneDay;
  const hint = g('hint').reports.length;
  const misTagged = g('parser').taggedAs.hint + g('hint').taggedAs.parser;
</script>

[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) was marked known: one issue, one fix queued. It is three problems
with three fixes. The {merged.length} reports in it split like this:

| problem | reports | ticket |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `parser`: the shared parser reads every date month first | {parser} | [issue 1](https://github.com/siarheidzyhun/Mega/issues/1) |
| `hint`: booking-v3 prints `MM/DD/YYYY` under the date field | {hint} | [issue 2](https://github.com/siarheidzyhun/Mega/issues/2) |
| one-day shift: a date off by one day, not flipped | {oneDay} | [issue 3](https://github.com/siarheidzyhun/Mega/issues/3) |

<Callout>
Fixing the parser closes {parser} of {merged.length}. The other {hint + oneDay} stay broken.
</Callout>

## Where the cause comes from

The cause depends on the tenant: its locale and the booking form it runs. Intake only guesses from
the reporter's browser, and the guess was wrong for {misTagged} reports, so counts here use the tenant.

<CauseTable ticket={4471} />

## Why the merge hid this

[Decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject) merges on the subject line alone. All three
problems arrive under the same dozen subjects, so nobody reading the subject could tell them apart.

## What to do

- Fix the parser for the {parser} reports. Then re-check the other two.
- Change the booking-v3 hint, or the way the form reads it, for the {hint} form reports at three tenants.
- Give the {oneDay} one-day reports to engineering. The cause is not confirmed; the reports point at time zones.

